#. y4:msg_decision_group=0
#. y4:msg_decision_choices=1. Act exactly like you do at the club. -> T0.P9 | 2. Be more guarded. -> T0.P23 | 3. Be more open. -> T0.P37
msgctxt "572_Akiyama"
msgid "(How <Italic>do</Italic> you interact with a customer on a date...?)"
msgstr "(¿Como <Italic>tener</Italic> una buena interacción con un cliente?...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "584_Akiyama"
msgid "You've got to act exactly the same, whether you're at the\\r\nclub or on a date."
msgstr "Tienes que actuar de la misma forma, que cuando estás en el club."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=0
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 0
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=10
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P10
#. y4:msg_speaker=Miki
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=7
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Act exactly like you do at the club.
msgctxt "596_Miki"
msgid "Really? Why?"
msgstr "¿En serio? ¿Por qué?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "608_Akiyama"
msgid "It would confuse the guy if you started acting differently\\r\njust because you weren't at work."
msgstr "El cliente se confundiría si empezaras a tratarlo diferente\\r\nde la nada, solo porque no estás en el trabajo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "620_Miki"
msgid "But wouldn't that make the whole \"going on a date\" thing\\r\nseem kind of pointless?"
msgstr "Eh... ¿Pero entonces eso de \"salir en una cita\"\\r\nno quedaría en algo inútil?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
