#. y4:msg_speaker_id=7
#. y4:msg_choice_index=1
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Act exactly like you do at the club.
msgctxt "680_Miki"
msgid "More guarded?"
msgstr "¿Más cautelosa?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "692_Akiyama"
msgid "That's right. You don't want him to think he can get away\\r\nwith something just because you're not at work."
msgstr "Así es. No tienes que dejar que piense que, él puede salirse con\\r\nla suya como si nada, solo porque no estás en el trabajo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "704_Miki"
msgid "But won't it make him feel uncomfortable if I'm on the\\r\ndefensive all the time? I mean, after he asked me out and\\r\neverything...?"
msgstr "¿Pero si estoy a la defensiva todo el tiempo, no hará\\r\nque se sienta incómodo? Después de que se\\r\ntomo la molestia de invitarme y todo eso..."

